  "scope": [
    "Separate historical Token evidence from current capture health in Usage and preflight projections.",
    "Show capture state, last successful observation, completed Work Item coverage, and actionable recovery without implying that stale totals are live.",
    "Run one bounded provider-observed real task after implementation to verify that the Token total and coverage advance without retaining prompts or hidden reasoning."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "A historical observation with a disabled or unavailable Codex Provider is reported as historical-only, not as currently capturing.",
    "Usage clearly shows current capture state, last captured time, observed-versus-completed Work Item coverage, and why uncaptured work is excluded.",
    "Local, private-viewer, responsive, and reduced-motion browser checks preserve authority and redaction boundaries.",
    "Focused tests and npm run verify pass at the exact candidate; one bounded real provider observation either advances Usage or records a truthful, bounded failure without fabricated data."
  ],
